{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1488870-when-is-demigod-scheduled-to-ship","id":1488870,"title":"When is Demigod scheduled to ship?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-08-02T12:54:19-07:00","id":1488870,"title":"When is Demigod scheduled to ship?","content":"Hello! I do not mean to be rude when I ask, but for those who have pre-ordered demigod, has it started shipping for you? Just was asking to know if I should call support or not. To clarify this was a pre-order, I wasn't able to back the game cuz I wasn't as liquid at the time.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12517-storyteller323","name":"Storyteller323","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12517_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"67"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-02T16:18:03-07:00","id":1488898,"title":"","content":"As of the most recent Monday Meeting Notes: <b>Scion Demigod </b>\u2013 Trad press files at printer.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25506-shepherdboi","name":"Shepherdboi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25506_1.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"364"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-17T11:10:25-07:00","id":1490522,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shepherdboi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1488870-when-is-demigod-scheduled-to-ship?p=1488898#post1488898\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As of the most recent Monday Meeting Notes: <b>Scion Demigod </b>\u2013 Trad press files at printer.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Apologies but idk what that means.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12517-storyteller323","name":"Storyteller323","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12517_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"67"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-17T11:24:40-07:00","id":1490523,"title":"","content":"It means they sent the files to the printer (a different company) to be print and soon they will have the books ready for shipping. Yet its not ready and they didnt tell when its going to happen, but probably very soon.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-17T12:17:53-07:00","id":1490526,"title":"","content":"As of the current Monday Meeting notes, the new status is &quot;<b>Scion Demigod </b>\u2013 KS books headed to fulfillment shipper.&quot;<br /> <br /> This means the books are printed and being shipped to the people who will send them to the Kickstarter backers. This doesn't tell us where it was printed, where the fulfillment shipper is based, or what method they're using to ship the pallet of books. If they were printed in China with ocean shipping to a fulfillment center in the US, it could still be weeks before it gets to port, clears customs, and gets put on a truck to the shipper, at which point they'll start mailing them to backers.<br /> <br /> I'm not sure where preorders fit into their mailing priorities.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25506-shepherdboi","name":"Shepherdboi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25506_1.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"364"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-17T12:30:29-07:00","id":1490527,"title":"","content":"If they are using the same fulfillment place as they usually do, my books have shipped out of Tennessee. Usually they print in China. So, boat from China, land on the west coast, and then truck to TN. At least, that's how the logistics company I work for would handle it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin","name":"Florin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"940"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-19T19:25:31-07:00","id":1490750,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Florin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1488870-when-is-demigod-scheduled-to-ship?p=1490527#post1490527\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If they are using the same fulfillment place as they usually do, my books have shipped out of Tennessee. Usually they print in China. So, boat from China, land on the west coast, and then truck to TN. At least, that's how the logistics company I work for would handle it.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I live in TN as well, so hey we'll be getting it around the same time. I just hope Dragon's printing doesn't take this long.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12517-storyteller323","name":"Storyteller323","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12517_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"67"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-22T05:07:44-07:00","id":1490984,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Storyteller323</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1488870-when-is-demigod-scheduled-to-ship?p=1490750#post1490750\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> I live in TN as well, so hey we'll be getting it around the same time. I just hope Dragon's printing doesn't take this long.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> The way I read what Rich has put in the MMN lately, they have been given windows in which their printer will print their books. So, it's kind of up to timing as to how long it takes a book to go from ready to print to printed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin","name":"Florin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"940"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-22T07:22:57-07:00","id":1490994,"title":"","content":"They're already printed, since they were at the printer two weeks ago and on the way to the fulfillment shipper last week. Looking up shipping times from China to America, it looks like it normally takes 2-4 weeks. I presume that doesn't include the time it takes to clear customs (on both sides) or load/unload the ship. So the books are presumably currently on a ship and may be on that ship for another one to three weeks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25506-shepherdboi","name":"Shepherdboi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25506_1.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"364"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-22T18:12:15-07:00","id":1491060,"title":"","content":"The newest Monday Meeting Notes are up. Demigod is still in transit to the fulfillment shipper, but we know from the article that Onyx Path haven't been printing books in China over the last several years, so without knowing where they're printed, we can't estimate how long it'll take to get to fulfillment. We'll just have to check the status every Monday night.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25506-shepherdboi","name":"Shepherdboi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25506_1.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"364"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}